      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-bg</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-bg for compilation:</para>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --release --no-default-features
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-bg /usr/bin/cosmic-bg &amp;&amp;

install -vd /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicBackground/v1 &amp;&amp;

install -vm644 data/v1/* -t /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicBackground/v1/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

